Patent 3506327 from 1970.

167
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:36,920
That was Emmett Leith, that's the Battel patent.

168
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:43,080
3838903 from 74, and 3838904 from 74 as well.

169
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:50,560
But I'd like to focus on the first, which was 3506327 from 1970.

170
00:24:50,800 --> 00:25:01,200
This patent, excuse me, is titled Wavefront Reconstruction Using a Coherent Reference Beam.

171
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:08,000
